The **Fournisseurs** module is designed to track financial relationships with external partners independently of the sales funnels. It operates as a double-entry ledger where transactions are either "Owed" (debts to the supplier) or "Paid" (payments made to clear them). Calculations are segmented by the nature of the transaction (Articles vs. Impressions) to provide granular transparency on partner balances.

The "Nouvelle Entrée" button issue was likely caused by strict Supabase insertion requirements or a lack of error feedback. I have updated the `addFournisseurLedger` function to explicitly include metadata and robust state handling.

